[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:04.92]left a single note and went on their way
[00:09.80]I never got their name until the credits
[00:14.00]now it plays here every single day
[00:17.88]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:23.00]One note at a time
[00:27.60]from people passing through
[00:33.50]a name beside a line
[00:38.52]and part of it is you
[00:43.60]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
